NV-82229"}, "name": "link_payment", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Invoice INV-82229 from Evergreen Catering is paid. It was paid once, by wire, for $2,678.09.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001 (wire, status sent)\n- **Invoice status:** now marked paid.\n\nThe first wire request timed out, so I didn't know whether it had gone through. I checked the payment list before retrying and found PAY0001 already sent. I linked it to the invoice instead of sending a second wire.\n\nThe amount was under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was needed. Evergreen's other invoices were not touched: INV-41994 was already paid, and INV-68593 ($1,408.64) is still in draft and awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}